{
  "slug": "deep-research",
  "name": "Deep Research",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Multi-agent deep research pipelines for Claude Code. Runs internet research, repository analysis, schema-driven structured research, and media research (via NotebookLM) using coordinated Agent Teams --- Haiku scouts build source corpora, Sonnet specialists verify and cross-challenge findings, and an Opus synthesizer produces the final output.  Drop-in plugin, no code dependencies.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **6 agents** and **2 commands**.\n\n- **Agents** (6): `repo-scout` (Haiku scout for Agent Teams-based repo research), `repo-specialist` (Sonnet topic specialist for Agent Teams-based repo research), `research-scout` (Haiku scout for Agent Teams-based deep research), `research-specialist` (Sonnet topic specialist for Agent Teams-based deep research), `research-synthesizer` (Opus sweep agent for Agent Teams-based deep research), `structured-synthesizer` (Opus synthesizer for Agent Teams-based structured research (Pipeline C v2.1))\n- **Commands** (2): `research` (PM-GATED: ask first; never from subagent), `setup` (Set up the deep-research plugin — verify Agent Teams, check pipeline availability, configure NotebookLM)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install deep-research@claude-community` from `oduffy-delphi/deep-research-claude`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "agent": 6,
    "command": 2
  },
  "sourceType": "community",
